    "detailed_description": "Unbalanced, a game where the roles are switched and you play as the villain. In this RPG you play as a psychotic killer who\u2019s on a goal to create unbalance in a world of balance. You go through the lands of Statera, killing anything that gets in your way, or even gazes at you. But very quickly you realize you\u2019re not going unnoticed.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Knights of Balance</h2>The Knights of Balance, Statera\u2019s primary force keeping the balance of the lands. The Knights are the only thing between you and your goal. Soon you\u2019ll find out the Knights aren\u2019t exactly what you\u2019d expect.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique Battle System!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>8 Unique Bosses &amp; many more mini bosses!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Many different weapons, items, armors and abilities!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Completely custom map!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 Playable Characters.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Original Art Style.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Original Soundtrack.</li></ul>",
